{"title":"Dune Scorpion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 26 Scorpion that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .2 | venomDamage: 6</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/deathstalker-venom\">Deathstalker Venom</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1020.9px,-2344.3px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/3/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:2048px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/3/9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:2304px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/4/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:2048px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/4/9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:2304px\"><i style=\"left:1089.0px;top:2259.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1094.5px;top:2261.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:882.8px;top:2304.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:885.5px;top:2308.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:888.3px;top:2301.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:860.8px;top:2329.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1174.3px;top:2373.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1171.5px;top:2363.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1163.3px;top:2370.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1116.5px;top:2388.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:959.8px;top:2431.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:965.3px;top: